# Citation metadata for ALBIS.
#
# GitHub reads this file to render the "Cite this repository" button and to
# offer APA and BibTeX exports. Keep `version` and `date-released` in step with
# VERSION on every release -- tests/test_version_consistency.py enforces the
# version half, and docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md carries the date.
#
# The DOI below is the concept DOI: it always resolves to the newest release,
# which is why it belongs in a file that outlives any one of them. Zenodo mints
# a separate version DOI per release and archives each tag automatically; see
# "Archive the Release for Citation" in docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ALBIS in work that leads to a publication, please cite it as below."
title: "ALBIS: an ALBULA-style viewer for DECTRIS detector data"
abstract: >-
  ALBIS is a free, open-source viewer for DECTRIS detector data, in the style
  of ALBULA. It opens HDF5 stacks in the filewriter1 and filewriter2 layouts,
  including multi-threshold data, TIFF, CBF and EDF images, and MYTHEN(2)
  acquisitions, from SELUN, EIGER(2), PILATUS(4), MYTHEN(2), POLLUX and
  JUNGFRAU detectors and the electron-microscopy detectors ARINA, SINGLA,
  QUADRO and ELA. It follows a running experiment through the SIMPLON
  monitor stream, a JUNGFRAUJOCH preview stream or externally pushed frames,
  and runs on the user's computer or on the machine that holds the data,
  viewed from a browser elsewhere. It draws resolution rings from the detector
  geometry, including multi-panel detectors and non-square pixels, shows pixel
  values when zoomed in, and provides region-of-interest statistics, spot
  finding, pixel mask handling, series summation, an HDF5 dataset inspector,
  and export to TIFF and CBF with the source metadata, to PNG figures and to
  animated GIF.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Grimm
    given-names: Sascha Andres
    email: sascha.grimm@dectris.com
    affiliation: DECTRIS AG
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SaschaAndresGrimm/ALBIS"
url: "https://github.com/SaschaAndresGrimm/ALBIS"
license: MIT
version: 0.25.2
date-released: 2026-10-10
keywords:
  - image viewer
  - synchrotron
  - X-ray detector
  - electron microscopy
  - DECTRIS
  - HDF5
  - crystallography
  - scientific visualization
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22046648"
    description: "Concept DOI resolving to the latest ALBIS release."
